#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:87
#: 38e55130e48a4f14bb10852ce8a339bb
msgid ""
"If there have been updates to some git submodules you may need to do a full "
"clean build. To do that use:"
msgstr "如果某些 git 子模块有更新，可能需要进行完整的清理构建，使用以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:93
#: 663b28fb6bc645918ce2c39a572deff8
msgid ""
"Commands `clean` and `distclean` can be used to clean the objects produced "
"by the build. `clean` keeps the configure information, cleaning only the "
"objects for the current board. `distclean` cleans everything for every "
"board, including the saved configure information."
msgstr ""
"`clean` 和 `distclean` 命令可用于清理构建产物。`clean` 保留配置信息，仅清理当前板的构建产物。`distclean` "
"清理所有板的所有内容，包括已保存的配置信息。"

